s ao bem-estar, à atividade física e ao relaxamento\nPrivate Rooms\nConcierge e experiências exclusivas\nMenu de serviços essenciais e à la carte\nVagas para visitantes\n\nUma proposta de moradia que vai além do espaço físico, integrando conforto, tempo e qualidade de vida.\nSeu bem-estar em 360°.\n\nEntre em contato para negociarmos este lugar incrível, ideal para viver em Curitiba.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6839a65f93344dfff9e42d3b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f4b46322-4dae-4c72-8de8-2ab099c02863.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6839a65f93344dfff9e42d3b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fbbdc762-07ce-426c-93f8-8b99aae73a16.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6839a65f93344dfff9e42d3b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6ae120e0-6496-4b81-a113-261596d88d10.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6839a65f93344dfff9e42d3b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/afc00943-82d3-410e-94b9-6288910a8034.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6839a65f93344dfff9e42d3b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9cd88817-f3fc-4317-bf80-46c1091cb7e3.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6839a65f93344dfff9e42d3b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c1651f55-71a8-4edf-ad6e-fb87fd270897.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6839a65f93344dfff9e42d3b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/ebc76127-94a1-4614-85b8-3ac1b2afe261.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6839a65f93344dfff9e42d3b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/add0ac5d-f5d4-48b7-b4ff-c87aee9cfb97.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6839a65f93344dfff9e42d3b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a269a843-3c41-4557-af4d-2666c769cbf8.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6839a65f93344dfff9e42d3b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e3f4dafb-2d12-430f-9efa-4d0a006fac31.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6839a65f93344dfff9e42d3b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2f1bc42